    Bug 1840861 - Show a warning in composer if the user's configured OpenPGP key will expire SOON. r=edicharry

    - Warn if key expiry is less than 31 days.
    - The browser_expiredKey.js test was using an incorrect (for wrong user) key as valid key. Fixed the test to have correct key, and fixed changing key expiry to be in one central place.
    - The warning we had did not work when changing to secondary identity. Opening the account setting is not 100% what we want... it should rather be the *identity* settings - leaving this for later.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D253461

